177
00:12:33,460 --> 00:12:34,520
You're a damn Amazon!

178
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:39,240
It's not like this Ryu has a girlfriend or anything. You just gotta keep pushing!

179
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,960
