192
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:12,540
But whatever works.

193
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:13,300
Huh?

194
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:13,500
Huh?

195
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:16,340
Huh?

196
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:20,880
I'm so sorry for the weird thing I said to you last night. Please forget it happened.

197
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:23,980
No, no, it's fine. I'm sorry my brother interrupted.

198
00:13:24,660 --> 00:13:27,100
What? I don't think I even knew you had a brother.

199
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:29,260
