Be sure to do your best out there today.

221
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:47,260
There's absolutely nothing I hate more in the world than going up against crap players.

222
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:53,300
Power players are freaks.

223
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:54,720
Yeah, I'm sorry about that.

224
00:14:54,980 --> 00:14:57,020
