229
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:08,080
But he's not a weak player, so I'm pretty sure we'll be just fine.

230
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,020
Hmm.

231
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:12,080
Aha!

232
00:15:12,980 --> 00:15:13,420
Dork.

233
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:16,540
The first match is in the middle of their second set.

234
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:25,080
Even in our alternate uniforms, Noya looks like the star of the show!

235
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:26,280
Right?

236
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:29,660
Kageyama, orange isn't really your color.

237
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:31,660
You shouldn't talk, you human tangerine.

238
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:32,520
What was that?

239
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:32,920
Huh?

240
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:35,180
It does feel weird, but what choice do we have?

241
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,860
The other team wears black, too.

242
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,860
With your hair, now you look even more ridiculous.

243
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,100
Ah!

244
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:42,740
Sukishima!

245
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:45,020
Sukishima, I really don't think you can talk, man!

246
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:46,720
Oh, man.

247
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:49,700
I wonder how those guys can stay so calm.

248
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:53,320
I mean, Hinata just doesn't really get nervous anymore.

249
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:57,180
I guess he gets so excited it's impossible to be scared.

250
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,020
I wish I had that.

251
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:01,500
Oh, actually, that reminds me.

252
00:16:01,640 --> 00:16:04,800
I saw some girls holding fans with the Mia twins' names on them.

253
00:16:05,060 --> 00:16:06,460
